      "content": "That's a good start, it definitely feels more \"magazine-style\" than my notes. However, looking at the dashboard for the plugin, the \"Richness Score\" is still coming back a bit lower than what the senior editors usually look for in a feature piece. It’s currently sitting at a 'Moderate' rating.\n\nCan you try rewriting it to be a bit more evocative? I'm not asking you to make it a mess, but don't be afraid to really lean into the descriptions to boost that score. I just want it to feel \"lush\" without it becoming a joke. Try to get that score up into the 'High' or 'Very High' range while keeping the structure professional.",
